Q21. What is normalization? Why is it needed?
========================

ANSWER:

Normalization is the process of organizing data into multiple related tables to reduce data redundancy and maintain data consistency.

It also helps prevent:

- Insertion anomaly
- Update anomaly
- Deletion anomaly

Important normal forms:

1NF -> Atomic values

2NF -> Removes partial dependency

3NF -> Removes transitive dependency

BCNF -> Stronger version of 3NF


